flowchart TB
    Patient[Prospective Patient]
    Admin[Clinic Admin]
    Staff[Front Desk Staff]

    FE[Vercel Frontend\nReact + TypeScript + react-i18next]
    API[Render Backend API\nFastAPI Modular Monolith]
    DB[(Supabase PostgreSQL)]
    Auth[Supabase Auth + JWT]
    Storage[Supabase Storage]
    Turnstile[Cloudflare Turnstile]
    Email[Resend]
    Sentry[Sentry]
    Maps[Google Maps Embed]
    WhatsApp[WhatsApp Deep Link]

    Patient --> FE
    Admin --> FE
    Staff --> FE

    FE -->|HTTPS JSON APIs| API
    FE -->|Admin/staff sign-in| Auth
    FE -->|Challenge public inquiry submission| Turnstile
    FE -->|Location lookup| Maps
    FE -->|Optional follow-up handoff| WhatsApp

    API -->|Persist content, inquiries, roles| DB
    API -->|Validate identity and role context| Auth
    API -->|Verify anti-spam token| Turnstile
    API -->|Store media references| Storage
    API -->|Send internal notifications| Email

    FE -->|Frontend errors and releases| Sentry
    API -->|Backend errors and releases| Sentry
